# Diameter Telecom Architecture Overview

This library extends the base [diameter](mdc:../diameter) library with telecom-specific functionality for 3GPP networks.

## Core Architecture

### Session Management
- **`SessionManager`**: Centralized business logic and message processing
- **`Sessions`**: Pure data management for session collections
- **`Subscribers`**: Subscriber data management

### Applications
- **`GxApplication`**: Policy and Charging Control (PCRF-PCEF)
- **`RxApplication`**: Application Function (PCRF-AF)  
- **`SyApplication`**: Spending Limit Control (PCRF-OCS)

### Session Types
- **`GxSession`**: Gx-specific with framed IP, APN, SGSN info
- **`RxSession`**: Rx-specific with `gx_session_id` for binding
- **`SySession`**: Sy-specific with `gx_session_id` for binding

## Key Files
- [session_manager.py](mdc:src/diameter_telecom/diameter/session_manager.py) - Main business logic
- [sessions.py](mdc:src/diameter_telecom/diameter/session/sessions.py) - Session data management
- [custom_simple_threading_application.py](mdc:src/diameter_telecom/diameter/app/custom_simple_threading_application.py) - Base application class